<view class="page"><text class="eyebrow">YOUR SPACE, YOUR RULES</text><view class="title">我的相伴空间</view><view class="subtitle">记住什么，忘掉什么，都由你决定。</view>
  <view class="card"><view class="row"><text class="section-title">今日聊天体验</text><text class="badge">{{mode === 'demo' ? '本地模拟' : '云端模型'}}</text></view><view class="quota-number">{{bootstrap.chatRemaining === undefined ? '—' : bootstrap.chatRemaining}}<text> / {{bootstrap.chatDailyLimit || '—'}} 轮</text></view><view class="hint">成功才扣体验额度；云端调用失败也可能产生供应商费用。另受全站调用预算约束。</view></view>
  <view class="card" wx:if="{{bootstrap.contentReview.mode === 'internal-test'}}"><view class="section-title">模型连接</view><view class="setting-help">{{!bootstrap.contentReview.eligible ? '当前账号尚未获得访问权限' : !bootstrap.enabled ? '已获访问权限，服务端模型尚未开启' : '已连接真实模型（调用可能计费）'}}</view><button class="text-button" bindtap="copyTestId">复制本账号接入标识</button><view class="hint">标识用于维护者配置服务端访问权限，不是密钥；前端不能自行授权。数据去向请查看使用与隐私说明。</view></view>
  <view class="card"><view class="section-title">保存与记忆</view><view class="setting-row"><view class="setting-text"><view class="setting-label">保存会话</view><view class="setting-help">每会话40条正文 / 30天；关闭后暂停新聊天，不删除旧记录</view></view><switch color="#07a65a" checked="{{bootstrap.settings.historyEnabled}}" data-field="historyEnabled" bindchange="changeSetting" disabled="{{busy || bootstrap.status !== 'ACTIVE'}}"/></view><view class="setting-row"><view class="setting-text"><view class="setting-label">使用已确认记忆</view><view class="setting-help">默认关闭。关闭将清空旧会话正文，条目另行管理</view></view><switch color="#07a65a" checked="{{bootstrap.settings.memoryEnabled}}" data-field="memoryEnabled" bindchange="changeSetting" disabled="{{busy || bootstrap.status !== 'ACTIVE'}}"/></view><view class="setting-row" bindtap="roles"><text>按角色管理记忆与资料</text><text>›</text></view></view>
  <view class="card"><view class="section-title">数据与隐私</view><view class="setting-row" bindtap="legal"><text>使用与隐私说明</text><text>›</text></view><view class="setting-row" bindtap="exportData"><text>导出我的陪伴数据</text><text>›</text></view><view wx:if="{{exportPath}}"><view class="hint">已生成本地未加密文件，请妥善保管。</view><button class="text-button" bindtap="shareExport">手动选择接收位置 / 分享文件</button></view><view class="setting-row" bindtap="clearCompanion"><text class="danger">清空全部陪伴数据</text><text>›</text></view><view class="setting-row" bindtap="revoke"><text>撤回使用授权</text><text>›</text></view><view class="setting-row" bindtap="deleteAccount"><text class="danger">删除账号业务数据</text><text>›</text></view></view>
  <view class="card"><view class="section-title">开发与接入</view><view class="setting-row" bindtap="modePicker"><view class="setting-text"><view>运行模式</view><view class="setting-help">{{mode === 'demo' ? '本地固定模板，不进行真实AI推理' : bootstrap.provider}}</view></view><text>切换 ›</text></view><view class="setting-row" bindtap="legacy"><text>旧版：三条回复建议</text><text>›</text></view><view class="setting-row" bindtap="legacyHistory"><text>旧版历史与清理</text><text>›</text></view><view class="setting-row" bindtap="profiles"><text>旧版表达档案与记忆</text><text>›</text></view><view class="setting-row" bindtap="clearHistory"><text>清空旧版建议历史</text><text>›</text></view><view class="setting-row" bindtap="clearMemory"><text>清空旧版档案记忆</text><text>›</text></view><view class="setting-row" wx:if="{{mode === 'demo'}}" bindtap="reset"><text>重置本地演示</text><text>›</text></view></view><view class="footer-note">相伴 · V{{version}}</view>
</view>
